\q2 we will also live with him;

verse_records.body_text:
if we endure,
we will also reign with him.
If we disown him,
he will also disown us;

verse_records.body_text_exact:
if we endure,
we will also reign with him.
If we disown him,
he will also disown us;

verse_records.body_text:
if we are faithless,
he remains faithful,
for he cannot disown himself.

